    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944130/extras/84edd6510e9c84b6745e25f644fe412a.avif?t=1676862776\" /></div>.<br>BrainAccelerator is a multiplayer TPS.<br>Customize your inventory uniquely and strategize to win.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Utilize your Bullet Time and strategically pack your enemies!!! </h2>In BrainAccelerator, when a threat approaches a player, all players on the map enter Bullet Time.<br>Dodge bullets and blasts, and run around the battlefield as you wish.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Defeat the Champion! </h2>Players are free to enter battles at will.<br>When you become a champion, your kill points, damage, score, and survival time will be added up and you will be registered in the ranking!<br>Aim for the top ranking!<br><br>For more information, plans, and announcements about the game's development, join our Discord now!<br>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944130/extras/84edd6510e9c84b6745e25f644fe412a.avif?t=1676862776\" /></div>.<br>BrainAccelerator is a multiplayer TPS.<br>Customize your inventory uniquely and strategize to win.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Utilize your Bullet Time and strategically pack your enemies!!! </h2>In BrainAccelerator, when a threat approaches a player, all players on the map enter Bullet Time.<br>Dodge bullets and blasts, and run around the battlefield as you wish.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Defeat the Champion! </h2>Players are free to enter battles at will.<br>When you become a champion, your kill points, damage, score, and survival time will be added up and you will be registered in the ranking!<br>Aim for the top ranking!<br><br>For more information, plans, and announcements about the game's development, join our Discord now!<br>",
